        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Established with the strategic mission of producing globally competent computing professionals, the <strong>Department of Computer Applications</strong> at RV University stands at the intersection of rigorous theoretical foundations and contemporary industry practice.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
